n_issues":0,"closed_issues":57,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-08-16T17:06:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T05:20:59Z","due_on":"2024-09-17T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2024-09-22T15:19:11Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-08-24T19:38:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-23T01:59:12Z","closed_at":"2024-08-26T16:46:55Z","assignee":{"login":"arjan-bal","id":46515553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE1NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46515553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal","html_url":"https://github.com/arjan-bal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/7559","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7559","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7559.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7559.patch","merged_at":"2024-08-26T16:46:55Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7241\r\n\r\n## Background\r\nThe test is sometimes getting a second load report before the client closes the stream. The test is setting the load report interval to 50 ms here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/cfd14baa8264cbeebf6308a7b68333c8c2fc6e86/xds/internal/xdsclient/loadreport_test.go#L106-L109\r\n\r\nIn the final assertion of the test, the test is checking that the very next request present in the fake server's request channel is the client cancellation: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/cfd14baa8264cbeebf6308a7b68333c8c2fc6e86/xds/internal/xdsclient/loadreport_test.go#L136-L138\r\n\r\nWhen the the test takes more than 50 ms b/w sending the first LRS response with the load report interval and this final assertion, another load report can be sent by the client here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/cfd14baa8264cbeebf6308a7b68333c8c2fc6e86/xds/internal/xdsclient/transport/loadreport.go#L136-L150\r\n\r\n## Repro\r\nTo make the test fail with a similar error message (`loadreport_test.go:139: unexpected LRS request: &{ <nil>}, <nil>, want error canceled`) add a `time.Sleep(100 * time.Millisecond)` just after receiving the first LRS request on the server here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/cfd14baa8264cbeebf6308a7b68333c8c2fc6e86/xds/internal/xdsclient/loadreport_test.go#L113-L116\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\nThis PR keeps reading from `fs2.LRSRequestChan.Receive` until we get an error due to context expiration or see the expected client context cancellation response.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: None","closed_by":{"login":"arjan-bal","id":46515553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE1NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46515553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal","html_url":"https://github.com/arjan-bal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7559/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7559/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}